#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:5 3b294a0f57eb4afa9ec87cae87d42e0a
#: 6dfb1c7d46a943509fb47f00764a8d8b af6977734bc64c4f9e8846c598c72a3b
#: d44f0fff8a184559a6ae0120c829cab9
msgid "MicoAir MTF-01 Optical Flow Sensor"
msgstr "MicoAir MTF-01 光流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:9 86b382f8b0204010a0df45c521ade65c
#: abb5b41176dd42999c18b8b68eea04d6 d5c2f89a596746d9baa12c4388595a65
#: ed1e1393541149a3809ce3967053cdbb
msgid ""
"The is a lightweight 2 in 1 optical flow sensor including a short range "
"lidar which uses the serial MAVLink protocol to communicate with the "
"autopilot.  This can be used to improve horizontal position control "
"especially in GPS denied  or indoor environments."
msgstr ""
"这是一款轻量级二合一光流传感器，集成短距离激光雷达，通过串行 MAVLink 协议与飞控通信。可用于改善水平位置控制，尤其在无 GPS 或室内环境中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:16 77d44d15091a4d988149e789bb85b2c3
#: ae7d737b9e0c4a1487d93e0fa5035aa2 bf366a77a740477d900df424a234fdff
#: c50c2c07d9db46c880c9b3069f4d2d0d
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:18 0e90d4cea3cc489fafe401c5793089c6
#: 82c8ec9ea29e4a679a569bfaa9225ee4 9c4bdd0283db4f55abee6fc48688a537
#: be0d56e0166b4c01b2de658e5fed507f
msgid ""
"The sensor is available from `Aliexpress "
"<https://www.aliexpress.us/item/3256805359467554.html>`__ and other "
"resellers"
msgstr ""
"该传感器可从 `速卖通 <https://www.aliexpress.us/item/3256805359467554.html>`__ "
"及其他经销商购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:21 145fa6435a934d5eb7efd39ae26f04c8
#: 45e8454e94a74979a5324666fcaf0cff 549e4b2ec67a49ea95eba7750765671c
#: 8824325d22e043438497607475e2a680
msgid "Sensor Setup"
msgstr "传感器配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:23 33dbda2e609b4ad6a4faffdd3951708c
#: 3f51173c2a8c467eaa20307677b891fa 66ba844cdff7437691c773bfb436b92d
#: caa7f46c1c9b47779c3fdc3ee77ce76d
msgid ""
"Use MicoAir's MicoAssistant software using an FTDI adapter (USB to serial) "
"to set its output protocol to \"mav-apm\"."
msgstr "使用 MicoAir 的 MicoAssistant 软件通过 FTDI 适配器（USB 转串口）将其输出协议设置为「mav-apm」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:30 17246d3d35b84e719f74729f4c57f0e8
#: 8a9d8b1bf6a341bea6464dbb9e2a317a cf10516f076240f9a4e0a183efade5d3
#: cf991194f08742cf990f492d9516d293
msgid ""
"With firmware versions 4.5.0 or above, MTF-01 may not be recognized by "
"Ardupilot unless you  use MicoAssistant to modify its “mav_id” to 200(any "
"value other than 1) and configure whichever serial port's "
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` its connected to  on the autopilot from \"0\" to "
"\"1024\"(“Don’t forward mavlink to/from” option)."
msgstr ""
"对于 4.5.0 或更高版本的固件，除非使用 MicoAssistant 将其「mav_id」修改为 200（任何非 1 的值），并将飞控上所连接串口的"
" ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` 从「0」配置为「1024」（「不转发 mavlink」选项），否则 MTF-01 可能无法被 "
"ArduPilot 识别。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:33 170befd7e8ff47fcb1eb88bacc09c706
#: 1b5503d6b2af48edb219bd5cb5eb90c7 9cc12a8255df4c57b8c9e7c493660503
#: d114a798bf564fb58954063b2a9447f6
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr "与飞控的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:39 4d7b402b8b134ad1b3fe1b1bc45660c8
#: b9bd53937e3c4c9996fbc497217f5091 c7538a136d034cf5a7e6d1cfd58bfc75
#: df2e2db9e71c4a0d9482ee5815b3e2b9
msgid ""
"The flow sensor should be mounted on the underside of the copter with the "
"camera lens pointing downwards."
msgstr "光流传感器应安装在飞行器底部，相机镜头朝下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:40 83c87642feb048939f492bdec50d10a7
#: ac9b9e7ceb054845b448528c12d58bf6 b52554debc9d4c8d885d4b111399be42
#: efc1448658954dc4953b8b7c1f67fd79
msgid "Connect the sensor to the autopilots' serial port"
msgstr "将传感器连接到飞控的串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:43 643527e083094c9a91c91845edfa2b50
#: 8ef9021e6f4b401ea087e255239ed2f8 a2bacfd943df4ed68bc60e89d26e69b1
#: ff88c51780f94a889d0fbef7c1dd9318
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:44 13935638a87e4ecfb8b111440b95fd6e
#: 40449220cde643a686e7149f70d896ab c834e833f053448390a87619d99b741c
#: d19ad3a4445a49d5837c52b4ba3f1b59
msgid ""
"For the following we will assume it will be connected to Serial1 port of the"
" autopilot. Any serial port can be used, however."
msgstr "以下假设连接到飞控的 Serial1 端口。但可以使用任意串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:46 3be49b14a9834aed880799b0cfdd946e
#: 723235f616684192b2d3a088f2a346a5 a7a2a146ad994ec0b2176257cdd344d1
#: b8015dad45f547dc9a0fbd6c2620ef5b
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD<SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD<SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:47 578b293cb04a4099aeede91245e4ef9e
#: 628e62d4e08948cb908659a54f92965c 6b4aaacb01724105bb3c4fec669247df
#: 86a47f0a9b2c4aca929c426d73a084db
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink1)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 1（MAVLink1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:48 7f34e3afe6be4d3d91f2ba9d3f305c4e
#: 8608df53ff284db3acdb295a1ce3d885 b8d221f7293945b4b4529f0297ea1db3
#: d53fa372cc994135a9690d1ebdb8a397
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE<FLOW_TYPE>` = 5 (MAVLink)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE<FLOW_TYPE>` = 5（MAVLink）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:49 096291f4b02e4dc5a989c24a8608053f
#: 70c69b8bd81c4b9fad6088f1689c5c51 9c78ce9e3c84481b9a848e00379220f1
#: e96c367407a2402f949bcc33d38737a6
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 10 (MAVLink)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 10（MAVLink）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:50 88b00e90680c4801af30bde8636cbe83
#: a70265075aca46c9b10475d3b77699a5 b83a3b89c9f044879a605e8a257afb56
#: f6f169944b9c42d9a9d9845bf8dd1871
msgid "Reboot autopilot to see rangefinder parameters"
msgstr "重启飞控以查看测距仪参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:51 4c26fae4250b4e3bb59ead58b75afec1
#: 6bb0656337f443a18ee2de9b56e9d30d 787475c7be34455c87bcd47971aab875
#: 81c7b9b56800445c907284a4adb71c9e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 8 to set range finder's maximum range"
" to 8m"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 8，将测距仪最大量程设为 8m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:52 2ef2eeeded8e4a708fbf0e3bfbe97d4c
#: 395441bb2cd44c978d46a7928f223dd3 3e763b17d2714a05b6c745dccf229766
#: e824f867ac494f7dacb0e6fc312fc199
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.01"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.01"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:53 18e3fe502a27499a91c9657110874514
#: 59974e71a9c4488e81493d3613c545bf 651a049a50d4444b9ebb178d15ccf792
#: f3b9c9d1052b49588d100ffbd9fc47c0
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (Downward)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（朝下）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:55 68166cdfee5d4e0f85d14d41765b1183
#: d8a5cf29e7984285878ca3c29517a182 f1eca0a1bae64da49d25efc79eea0d98
#: f862f208f43144dcb9033094191046a0
msgid ""
"Once the sensor is active you should be able to observe the optical flow and"
" range sensor data on the Mission Planner’s “Status” page. The “opt_qua” and"
" “rangefinder1” should have some value."
msgstr ""
"传感器激活后，你应该能在 Mission Planner "
"的「Status」页面上观察到光流和测距仪数据。「opt_qua」和「rangefinder1」应有数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:58 9740c6f6feb74ef881bc19cc1e54658b
#: a4dcb8685aeb4ff9ab11a30bd80c24b4 c9273c2a1f6e452f898a2156d210dd09
#: dbd5e249dee7494b867f4ceab5dde980
msgid "Optical Flow Use and Calibration"
msgstr "光流使用与校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:60 9553020a6f25442aa153b9c4ec9ee138
#: a1b8d315c25845679c5ca8ffaf4219a2 c0fcb26008a1441eb92bf90514e65dce
#: e87555bb051d4430ac11b9285b7ce2b1
msgid ""
"Be sure to follow the setup and calibration instructions and parameters for "
":ref:`Optical Flow setup <common-optical-flow-sensor-setup>` and how to "
"switch between outdoor(GPS) and indoor (Optical Flow) positioning."
msgstr ""
"请务必遵循 :ref:`光流传感器配置 <common-optical-flow-sensor-setup>` "
"的配置和校准说明及参数，以及如何在室外（GPS）和室内（光流）定位之间切换。"
